  "content": "\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/WQfwvh9/sssa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"476\" height=\"371\"></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">Ресурспак с альтернативным пиксельным знаком восклицания для мода «Aggro Indicator».&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aggroindicator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LX01BsyS/638237174759435587-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a></h3>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\">Скачайте оригинальный мод от <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/raverbury\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Raverbury</a>.</h5>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/DDC5dY0Q/2025-06-16-15-37-37.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3440\" height=\"1440\"></p>\n<p>Значок был сильно вдохновлён <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/full-grown-crop-marker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FullGrownCropMarker</a>.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Посмотрите мои другие проекты:</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/beyond-horizon-ultimate-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bjJknNzv/Unbenannt-11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"174\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/server-beyond-horizon-ultimate-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bY8SVz0/Unbenannt-22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"173\" height=\"173\"></a></strong></p>",
